date of production</a>

</ul>
<P>
<a NAME="4.3.c"></a>C. <a href="elements.html#4_4.3.c">Elements
used selectively to assist effective communication:</a>


<ul><a href="elements.html#4_4.3.c.1">1.
neatlines</a>
<p>&nbsp;<a href="elements.html#4_4.3.c.2">2.
locator maps</a>
<p>&nbsp;<a href="elements.html#4_4.3.c.3">3.
inset maps</a>
<p>&nbsp;<a href="elements.html#4_4.3.c.4">4.
index maps</a>

</ul>
</ul>
